<title>INDONESIA: Bank Umum pays 70.59 rupiah dividend.</title>
<headline>Bank Umum pays 70.59 rupiah dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's PT Bank Umum Nasional said on Monday it would pay a dividend of 70.59 rupiah per share for 1996.</p>
<p>The total dividend payment would amount to 22.1 billion rupiah, or 33.1 percent of the bank's 1996 net profit of 66.7 billion rupiah, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bank posted a net profit of 53.25 billion rupiah in 1995.</p>
<p>Bank Umum said the bank's priority this year would remain on efforts to strengthen its position in the commercial and retail sectors.</p>
<p>It did not give further details.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
